                        title: '1. MPU6050 互補濾波姿態角計算演算法',
                        code: `/* MPU6050 互補濾波姿態角計算 */
void Calculate_Attitude(float ax, float ay, float az, float gx, float gy, float dt) {
    float p_acc = atan2(-ax, sqrt(ay*ay + az*az)) * 57.2958f;
    float r_acc = atan2(ay, az) * 57.2958f;
    pitch = 0.96f * (pitch + gx * dt) + 0.04f * p_acc;
    roll  = 0.96f * (roll + gy * dt)  + 0.04f * r_acc;
}`
                    },
                    {
                        title: '2. Hardware I2C 多暫存器讀取驅動',
                        code: `/* STM32 I2C 讀取 MPU6050 暫存器 */
uint8_t MPU6050_Read_Bytes(uint8_t reg_addr, uint8_t *data, uint8_t len) {
    return HAL_I2C_Mem_Read(&hi2c1, MPU6050_ADDR, reg_addr, I2C_MEMADD_SIZE_8BIT, data, len, 100);
}`
                    }
